docs/phase-0-prereg-amendment-1.md-51-The review found that the pre-registration, as signed, could be *passed by a
docs/phase-0-prereg-amendment-1.md-52-proof that does not protect the project*. H0 pre-registered that a
docs/phase-0-prereg-amendment-1.md-53-machine-checked proof would exist, but not **what it must prove**. That gap
docs/phase-0-prereg-amendment-1.md-54-is precisely the drift-vector formal-methods theater needs: months into the
