docs/phase-0-prereg-amendment-1.md-72-
docs/phase-0-prereg-amendment-1.md-73-The original's phrasing — "if the guarantee cannot be proven, there is
docs/phase-0-prereg-amendment-1.md-74-nothing worth building" — could be misread as one-shot: first failed proof
docs/phase-0-prereg-amendment-1.md-75-attempt, project over. That is not the claim and never was. The method is
docs/phase-0-prereg-amendment-1.md-76-iterative, as all modeling is: model, attempt proof, find the flaw, revise,
docs/phase-0-prereg-amendment-1.md-77-re-prove — with each revision recorded in the journal.
