docs/phase-0-prereg-amendment-1.md-398-construction is formalized twice — a TLA+ state machine and a symbolic
docs/phase-0-prereg-amendment-1.md-399-protocol model — and two formalisms of "the same" system can quietly
docs/phase-0-prereg-amendment-1.md-400-describe two subtly different systems, each verified, neither wrong,
docs/phase-0-prereg-amendment-1.md-401-jointly meaningless. The informal written proof must therefore include an
docs/phase-0-prereg-amendment-1.md-402-explicit **correspondence mapping** between the TLA+ transitions and the
docs/phase-0-prereg-amendment-1.md-403-symbolic tool's rules/facts, arguing that both describe the same
