docs/phase-0-prereg-amendment-9.md-148-**Profile `tessera-v1-strict`** (identifier and spec hash inside the signed bytes):
docs/phase-0-prereg-amendment-9.md-149-- *Encoding:* `formal/p8/ENCODING-V1.md` at the signing commit, including D-1 to D-17; number rule A9.8. If the
docs/phase-0-prereg-amendment-9.md-150-  hybrid branch is taken, the signing-commit baseline plus the branch-registration supplement (A9.6) governs it.
docs/phase-0-prereg-amendment-9.md-151-- *Receipt anchor, issue order, git target, root-KSK rule:* A9.5.
docs/phase-0-prereg-amendment-9.md-152-- *Signers, issuance window:* A9.6.
docs/phase-0-prereg-amendment-9.md-153-- *Authority:* DNSSEC for D plus the git key assertion, both required, n = 2.
docs/phase-0-prereg-amendment-9.md-154-- *Trust configuration* (ships with the verifier, never from the bundle): root KSK-2017 and KSK-2024 with separate
docs/phase-0-prereg-amendment-9.md-155-  publication, signing and reliance periods; the repository key; a signed, versioned set of pinned mainnet header hashes.
docs/phase-0-prereg-amendment-9.md-156-  A bundle header outside the pins gives `UNVERIFIABLE / HEADERS_NOT_COVERED`. The trust configuration's KSK
docs/phase-0-prereg-amendment-9.md-157-  periods are as known at release; snapshots after an unlisted rollover are `UNVERIFIABLE`.
docs/phase-0-prereg-amendment-9.md-158-- *Bundle:* spec identifier and hash (signed); spec and conformance vectors (content-addressed); a bound
docs/phase-0-prereg-amendment-9.md-159-  plain-language purpose preamble; a dependency manifest (RFC 8785, OpenPGP, the signature algorithms in use,
docs/phase-0-prereg-amendment-9.md-160-  SHA-256, SHA-1 for git object linkage, the DNSSEC algorithms in the chain, OTS, Bitcoin headers).
docs/phase-0-prereg-amendment-9.md-161-- *Verification:* strict only; one layer; no wrappers, renewal, TLR or waiver policy.
docs/phase-0-prereg-amendment-9.md:162:- *Stable field set* (A9.4): the verdict, its reason code, T, `revocation`, `historical_security` and standing.
docs/phase-0-prereg-amendment-9.md:163:- *Parameters:* A9.2.
docs/phase-0-prereg-amendment-9.md-164-- *Issuance:* an operated API (API Gateway + Lambda + KMS).
docs/phase-0-prereg-amendment-9.md-165-- *Issuer invariant:* a receipt ships only when complete; an operator refusal never concerns a shipped receipt.
