docs/phase-0-prereg-amendment-9.md-401-- **Declared-time check (issuer side, not a verifier rule).** The `gpg`-slot signer refuses a frame whose
docs/phase-0-prereg-amendment-9.md:402:  `declared_issue_time` is outside ε (A9.2) of its own clock. Whoever controls the queue (an AWS takeover) still
docs/phase-0-prereg-amendment-9.md-403-  has signing capability for both slots; the check limits that to minting at the current time. For an HSM-backed key,
