docs/V1-PROFILE.md-357-## 4. Issue order (issuer side, binding on the build)
docs/V1-PROFILE.md-358-
docs/V1-PROFILE.md-359-1. Fix the manifest and common metadata, including `declared_issue_time`.
docs/V1-PROFILE.md-360-2. Build both frames.
docs/V1-PROFILE.md-361-3. Sign each frame.
docs/V1-PROFILE.md-362-4. Verify both signatures with the exact bytes to be committed.
docs/V1-PROFILE.md-363-5. Freeze the signature bytes. Any re-framing happens before this point.
docs/V1-PROFILE.md-364-6. Build `A_sig` and stamp its SHA-256. One stamp per receipt.
docs/V1-PROFILE.md-365-7. Obtain and validate the confirmation and time evidence.
docs/V1-PROFILE.md-366-8. Ship the complete receipt.
