docs/V1-PROFILE.md-1129-- **Subpacket lengths.** RFC 9580 §5.2.3.7: first octet < 192, one octet; 192–254, two octets
docs/V1-PROFILE.md-1130-  `((o1−192)<<8)+o2+192` (192–16319); 255 followed by a four-octet big-endian value (five octets total). The length
docs/V1-PROFILE.md-1131-  counts the type octet and is ≥ 1. V1 accepts the shortest form only (a V1 rule, not an RFC ban); a longer form is
docs/V1-PROFILE.md-1132-  `SIG_FORMAT`. [OWNER 2026-10-14, G28; r2-F14] *(Dated correction 2026-10-14: "255, four octets" misdescribed the
